---
import BookLayout from "../layouts/BookLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<BookLayout
	title="A note — Book Reviews by Arjun"
	description="Why these book reviews by Arjun are collected here, and shared."
>
	<main class="note-page">
		<div class="wrap">
			<a class="back" href={`${base}/`}>&larr; Home</a>

			<h1>A note</h1>

			<div class="prose">
				<p>
					After Arjun passed, I stumbled upon these book reviews and
					found them comforting. They capture who he was so well:
					thoughtful, silly, and profound. Many of his family and
					friends remember his intellectual curiosity, and these
					reviews let me hear his voice again. I hope reading
					them&mdash;and perhaps picking up some of these
					books&mdash;helps you feel connected to him, too. His
					thoughts are still here, and there is so much more we can
					learn from him.
				</p>

				<p class="source">
					All the reviews come from his Goodreads account. The ratings
					and writing are preserved exactly as he left them&mdash;emojis,
					typos, line breaks, and all.
				</p>
			</div>

			<a class="btn" href={`${base}/#reviews`}>Reviews</a>
		</div>
	</main>
</BookLayout>

<style>
	.note-page {
		/* Comfortable room at the top without pushing the first line
		   below the fold. */
		padding: clamp(3rem, 9vh, 6rem) 0 clamp(4rem, 12vh, 7rem);
	}

	.back {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.1em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back:hover {
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0 0 clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.9rem);
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
	}

	.prose {
		/* Left-aligned at a reading measure: centering tires the eye once
		   the text runs past a few lines. */
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	.prose p {
		margin: 0 0 1.4em;
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.35rem);
		line-height: 1.7;
		text-wrap: pretty;
	}

	/* A quieter aside: it explains where the reviews came from rather
	   than continuing the thought above it. */
	.source {
		margin-top: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.1vw, 1.15rem) !important;
		color: var(--ink-soft);
	}

	.prose p:last-child {
		margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 3.5rem);
	}
</style>
